  "description": "A forensic file inspection library for .NET Standard 2.1. Identify true file types by binary and text magic-number signatures (headers, trailers, offsets, wildcards, and custom rules), resolve IANA MIME types bidirectionally, generate and verify cryptographic hashes (MD5, SHA-1, SHA-256, SHA-384, SHA-512) with constant-time comparison, detect Byte Order Marks (BOMs) and character encodings, and recognize structured text formats (JSON, JSON Lines, XML, CSV). Ideal for file upload validation, security scanning, firmware verification, and data pipelines.",
